DESCRIPTION:On select days through the holiday season\, the Gulfarium sets
  up a festive display where a family can pose beside an African penguin o
 r an American alligator. A trainer or staff member takes the photo on you
 r own phone\, so there is no print to buy. Guests may not touch the anima
